    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are people to talk to but it doesn't change anything. it doesn't make the silence go away. it's like i'm just existing in a void. i look at his side of the bed and it's just so empty. it's not even sadness anymore, it's just... a constant, crushing weight. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does.",
